        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 text-sm text-stone-600 space-y-3">
        <p id="role-modal-description">
          Are you sure you want to change this user's permissions?
        </p>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-lime-600/30 bg-[#d8ef8c]/25 p-3 text-xs text-forest-900">
          <strong>Security note:</strong> Administrators have full access to approve found items, verify custody releases, and moderate campus posts.
        </div>
